{"speciesId":396,"names":{"fr":"Étourmi","es":"Starly","en":"Starly","ja":"ムックル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"They flock in great numbers. Though small, they flap their wings with great power."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Usually with a large flock, it is barely noticeable when alone. Its cries are very strident."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La faiblesse des Étourmi les force à vivre en groupe, mais ils se chamaillent souvent."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La faiblesse des Étourmi les force à vivre en groupe, mais ils se chamaillent souvent."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ils volent en nombre. Bien que minuscule, il bat des ailes avec une vigueur impressionnante."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Viaja en grandes bandadas. Aunque es pequeño, agita las alas con gran fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They flock in great numbers. Though small, they flap their wings with great power."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"たくさんの 群れで 行動する。 体は 小さいが 羽ばたく 力は 非常に 強い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon très bruyant parcourt champs et forêts en nuées pour chasser les Pokémon Insecte."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sobrevuela los campos buscando Pokémon de tipo Bicho. Chilla de forma muy estridente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"むしポケモンを ねらって 野山を 大勢の 群れで 飛び回る。 鳴き声が とても やかましい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ils volent en nombre. Bien que minuscule, il bat des ailes avec une vigueur impressionnante."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Viaja en grandes bandadas. Aunque es pequeño, agita las alas con gran fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They flock in great numbers. Though small, they flap their wings with great power."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"たくさんの 群れで 行動する。 体は 小さいが 羽ばたく 力は 非常に 強い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon très bruyant parcourt champs et forêts en nuées pour chasser les Pokémon Insecte."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sobrevuela los campos buscando Pokémon de tipo Bicho. Chilla de forma muy estridente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"むしポケモンを ねらって 野山を 大勢の 群れで 飛び回る。 鳴き声が とても やかましい。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"They live in the fields and mountains, gathering in large flocks. Their cries are quite obnoxious. Though small, their wings are strong—a strike from them leaves pain that persists for a week."}],"varieties":[{"id":396,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[24,"level-up",1]]}